 " option."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->716279662,ExpressionUUID->"3c3f3176-19f8-4466-a359-ecbadab89d18"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Calling ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ContractionTree",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/ContractionTree"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"588715d6-85b1-438c-a3d8-453220649fc3"],
 " on a bare ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetwork",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetwork"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"d6b42e7c-5f43-47bb-a596-3a76bf45d3c8"],
 " expression triggers unbounded recursion: the head does not unwrap a \
network into its contraction expression. Always pass the result of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["TensorNetworkContraction",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/TensorNetworkContraction"]],
   "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"fda1686d-3a8f-49ae-a66b-330ee9ace5bd"],
 " (or another inactive contraction tree)."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->717011826,ExpressionUUID->"bf0d0171-276e-4380-ad17-51c105de2dee"],

