Cell["\<\
On larger networks the dimension-labeled tree exposes intermediate-tensor \
sizes; reading the subscripts shows which axes get contracted at each step, \
making it possible to spot path choices that create unexpectedly large \
intermediates:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->309375199,ExpressionUUID->"783bc6c0-b9f3-467f-a1f2-989902e0c5ac"],

